	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r18r0101_00_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うむ……▼
って　きもちは　うれしいが
ポケモンが　いっぱいで▽
タマゴを　うけとれないようだね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>うむ……▼
って　気持ちは　うれしいが
ポケモンが　一杯で▽
タマゴを　受け取れないようだね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択、手持ち一杯</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
